  "body": "Owed items after PR #2460 (issue #2436), from the review comment 6980642597:\n\n- `crates/motion/src/machining2d/contour_whole.rs:259` and `:298`: the `\\` line continuation is missing. Each message holds about 30 spaces in the middle.\n- No test pins the \"no floor level\" note, the band-limit error, or the `Some(j)` arm that leads into an in-between band.\n- `docs/decisions/2436-whole-model-contour-steps.md` does not record two choices:\n  - an in-between band instead of a refusal;\n  - a note instead of an error when that band has no floor level.\n- The error class is selected by a match on message text (`contour_whole.rs` near lines 78 and 186).\n- `first_split` compares the hole count after the tool offset.\n- `real_tip_contour.rs` has no whole-model twin now.\n- The note \"levels below skipped\" on an upper bore is misleading when a lower bore closes.\n\nFollow-up of PR #2460 (issue #2436).\n",
